# License

This repository contains Buddhist texts and translations from SuttaCentral's bilara-data repository.

## Data License (CC0)

All Buddhist texts and translations in this repository are released into the public domain under the [CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). You are free to use, modify, and distribute this content for any purpose without restriction.

## Source

This repository is a filtered copy of the [suttacentral/bilara-data](https://github.com/suttacentral/bilara-data) published branch, pruned to minimal data required by EBT-Site.

## Attribution

While not legally required under CC0, attribution to the original translators and SuttaCentral is appreciated. See individual text metadata for translator information.

## Original Copyright

Translations in SuttaCentral's bilara-data may have had various original copyright statuses. All are released under CC0 per SuttaCentral licensing requirements.

